    "deployedAdapterDiscrepancy": "The adapter currently deployed at 0x27677c837287b060D285d5C90096f06fBe675938 pins releaseAuthorityId = 0x130d619731ab2a03a81de297e058ef57a6a85656d0ddf76d26e7a20cfa2d3651, which is NOT the governed Ed25519 release authority below and could not be derived from it under any tested encoding. It also pins circuitHash and parameterFingerprint as keccak256 hashes of label strings rather than the governed sha256 content digests. This fixture is built under the corrected semantics above; the deployed adapter would revert with BadAuthority and BadCircuit until redeployed with the pins listed in expectedAdapterConstructorPins."
  },

